<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1381] Incorrect marshalling and/or unmarshalling of unregistered types</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1381</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Unmarshalling logic does not correspond to marshalling in case of unregistered types:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Write: PortableClassDescriptor.writeHeader. Header length includes the length of class name string.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Read: PortableReaderExImpl:2161 (&quot;rawOff += clsNameLen&quot;) implies that clsNameLen is not included in header length.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12862205">IGNITE-1381</key>
            <summary>Incorrect marshalling and/or unmarshalling of unregistered types</summary>
